WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.370
Brad: That was close.

2
00:00:06.371 --> 00:00:10.998
Tina: A little too close, if you ask me.

3
00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:13.919
Danny: It looks like we’re stuck again.

4
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.573
Now what are we going to do?

5
00:00:16.574 --> 00:00:19.998
We’ll never get to Ginormous from here. Brad:

6
00:00:19.999 --> 00:00:24.790
Ginormous! What about getting home?

7
00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.485
Danny: We can’t go home.

8
00:00:26.486 --> 00:00:28.736
You promised to help.

9
00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:32.649
Brad: I didn’t know we would end up trapped on a cliff!

10
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:36.369
Tina: Oh, Brad! We need to help the giants.

11
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:40.372
Imagine living in a world without color. Brad:

12
00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.948
Sure, that would be terrible. But

13
00:00:42.949 --> 00:00:45.717
why is it my problem? Danny:

14
00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:50.278
Because you can help, that’s why. Brad:

15
00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:53.012
I guess you’re right. Tina:

16
00:00:53.013 --> 00:00:56.263
Brad is right about one thing, though.

17
00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:58.230
Danny: What’s that?

18
00:00:58.231 --> 00:01:03.807
Tina: We are trapped on a cliff.

19
00:01:03.808 --> 00:01:05.261
Danny: Wait a minute.

20
00:01:05.262 --> 00:01:07.306
I’ve got an idea.

21
00:01:07.307 --> 00:01:10.988
Brad: What is it?

22
00:01:10.989 --> 00:01:16.572
Danny: See? We can use these to climb back up to the top.

23
00:01:16.573 --> 00:01:20.782
Tina: Great idea, Danny!

24
00:01:20.783 --> 00:01:24.423
Brad: Wow, that’s a long way.

25
00:01:24.425 --> 00:01:28.852
Tina: I didn’t realize we had fallen so far.

26
00:01:28.853 --> 00:01:32.733
I think it’s less scary if we climb down. Danny:

27
00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:35.047
It does look shorter.

28
00:01:35.048 --> 00:01:40.676
Brad: Either way, it’s not going to be easy.

29
00:01:40.677 --> 00:01:45.713
Tina: Let’s go for it!

30
00:01:45.714 --> 00:01:48.064
Danny: How are you guys doing?

31
00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:52.083
Tina: Not bad. These suction cups work great.

32
00:01:52.084 --> 00:01:57.512
Brad: It’s not as fun as the water slide, though.

33
00:01:57.513 --> 00:02:00.330
Danny: I think the rock is wetter here.

34
00:02:00.331 --> 00:02:03.397
Brad: It’s spray from the waterfall and the river.

35
00:02:03.398 --> 00:02:06.327
It means we’re getting closer to the bottom. Tina:

36
00:02:06.328 --> 00:02:10.711
It shouldn’t be much farther. Danny:

37
00:02:10.712 --> 00:02:14.085
I think my suction cups are slipping.

38
00:02:14.087 --> 00:02:16.408
Brad: The rocks are too slippery.

39
00:02:16.409 --> 00:02:19.020
Mine are slipping too.

40
00:02:19.021 --> 00:02:21.073
Tina: Let’s hurry up.

41
00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:24.046
Danny: Faster, everyone!

42
00:02:24.047 --> 00:02:25.725
Tina: Hold on!

43
00:02:25.727 --> 00:02:27.912
Danny: We’re going to fall!

44
00:02:27.913 --> 00:02:34.045
Brad: Oh no!

